<title>USA: Frontier Airlines May load factor slips.</title>
<headline>Frontier Airlines May load factor slips.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frontier Airlines Inc said on Wednesday that its May load factor slpped to 59.9 percent from 60.8 percent in May 1996.</p>
<p>The carrier flew 84,034,000 revenue passenger miles in May, a 39.6 percent increase from May 1996, it said.</p>
<p>Frontier recorded 140,325,000 available seat miles in May, up 41.6 percent from the year-ago month, the company said.</p>
</text>
